      "The serving command (python -m app.server --engine tiny --gallery DIR --labeler rule) cannot serve the tiny gallery: its manifest names a tower whose hash is not the tiny engine's, and the server refuses a gallery it cannot match to its engine ('the gallery was built with another image tower', exit 1). The check starts the app as the laptop's dev server does, create_app(tiny_gallery=True).",
